  SwiftTerm               1.10.1    MIT                             app
  swift-crypto            4.5.2     Apache-2.0                      app, shim
  swift-asn1              1.7.4     Apache-2.0                      app, shim (through swift-crypto)
  MCP Swift SDK           0.12.1    Apache-2.0 (parts MIT, see below) shim
  swift-nio               2.105.0   Apache-2.0                      shim (through the MCP SDK)
  swift-log               1.17.0    Apache-2.0                      shim (through the MCP SDK)
  swift-system            1.9.0     Apache-2.0                      shim (through the MCP SDK and swift-nio)
  swift-atomics           1.3.1     Apache-2.0                      shim (through swift-nio)
  swift-collections       1.7.6     Apache-2.0                      shim (through swift-nio)
  eventsource             1.6.0     MIT                             shim (through the MCP SDK)
  swift-argument-parser   1.8.2     Apache-2.0                      none (resolved for SwiftTerm's own tools only)

